flowchart TD
    USER[本機使用者]

    subgraph DESKTOP [Windows 本機桌面應用]
        direction LR

        subgraph UI [React／TypeScript UI]
            direction TB
            TABLE[6–9 人牌桌・1 User + 5–8 Bot]
            PARAM[牌桌・Bot・策略參數中心]
            RUN[互動 Play・批次執行]
            DASH[統計儀表板・13×13 熱力圖]
            REPLAY[全量 Log・逐手重播]
            ANIM[牌局動畫・off／fast／normal]
        end

        IPC[Tauri 型別化 IPC]

        subgraph RUST [Rust 單一權威引擎]
            direction TB
            CORE[牌局規則・合法行動・Side Pot・Rake]
            VIEW[每座 DecisionView・隱藏資訊隔離]
            STRAT[使用者策略引擎]
            BOT[Bot 決策・Persona × Level × 覆寫]
            EQUITY[Equity・Exact／Deterministic Sampling]
            STATS[統計・CI・Estimator・FDR]
            EVENTS[事件 Log・RunManifest・Checkpoint]
        end

        DB[(SQLite・策略・事件・聚合報表)]

        PARAM --> IPC
        RUN --> IPC
        IPC --> CORE
        CORE --> VIEW
        VIEW --> STRAT
        VIEW --> BOT
        CORE --> EQUITY
        CORE --> EVENTS
        EQUITY --> STATS
        EVENTS --> STATS
        STRAT --> EVENTS
        BOT --> EVENTS
        EVENTS --> DB
        STATS --> DB
        DB --> DASH
        DB --> REPLAY
        CORE --> TABLE
        TABLE --> ANIM
    end

    USER --> PARAM
    USER --> RUN
    USER --> DASH
    USER --> REPLAY
    BOUNDARY[不含真人多人連線・帳號・雲端・伺服器牌局]
    BOUNDARY -.-> DESKTOP
